cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below (preferred) and/or this repository."
title: "pas-mri-augmentation-radiomics"
abstract: >-
  Code for a radiomic-stability evaluation of data-agnostic augmentations (MixUp, CutMix,
  Auxiliary Fourier-basis Augmentation, and their combinations) for U-Net++ segmentation of
  the placenta in MRI. Trains the segmentation models, evaluates them in-domain and across
  modalities, applies five clinically-motivated MRI corruptions at severity level 3, extracts
  102 PyRadiomics features per (patient, mask), and quantifies how segmentation errors
  propagate to the radiomic feature signature.
type: software
